cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CNK-FarmaStatR: a reproducible platform for pharmaceutical statistics in education and research"
version: "1.0.0.9000"
authors:
  - family-names: "Yüksel"
    given-names: "Kıvanç"
    email: "kivancyuksel@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kivancy/CNK-FarmaStatR"
abstract: >-
  Research and education platform for pharmaceutical statistics: in vitro population
  bioequivalence (FDA PSG 020929) with simulation-based design selection, f2 and bootstrap f2,
  model-independent and Weibull multivariate statistical distance for dissolution profiles.
  Validated R cores run in the browser (webR); every result carries its seed, RNG and versions
  and can be reproduced from a link or an exported R script. Not a system validated for GxP
  environments.
keywords:
  - bioequivalence
  - population bioequivalence
  - dissolution
  - f2
  - simulation
  - R
  - webR
